  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-7" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The capital stock of respondent is owned fifty (50%) each by Alabama Power Company (Alabama) and Georgia Power Company (Georgia). The Southern Company (SOUTHERN), a registered holding company, owns all of the common stock of Alabama and Georgia.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
