        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Asset retirement and other cost of removal liabilities are recorded; related deferred income tax assets are recovered; and related deferred income tax liabilities are amortized over the related property lives, which may range up to 53 years.</span>
